/*
 * Marvel issues (Timely → Atlas → Marvel).
 *
 * Dates are COVER dates as "YYYY-MM" (or "YYYY" when only the year is known).
 * Cover dates historically ran 2–3 months ahead of the on-sale date.
 *
 * type:
 *   first    – first appearance of a character or team
 *   launch   – a series #1 / relaunch
 *   key      – a landmark story or turning point
 *   tiein    – tie-in or lead-in to an event (set `event` to the event id in events.js)
 *   milestone – industry / company history (not an issue)
 *
 * writers / artists / cover can be left empty and filled in later
 * (in the app via "Edit", then "Export data", or by editing this file).
 */
